> <span begin="2:02.289" end="2:05.372">lumina</span> <span begin="2:05.372" end="2:08.759">Ta!</span></p><p begin="2:08.759" end="2:18.775" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.759" end="2:10.637">Orice</span> <span begin="2:10.637" end="2:13.767">făptură</span> <span begin="2:13.767" end="2:15.645">poate</span> <span begin="2:15.645" end="2:16.271">să</span> <span begin="2:16.271" end="2:18.775">spună,</span></p><p begin="2:18.775" end="2:28.791" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.775" end="2:20.027">Spre</span> <span begin="2:20.027" end="2:23.783">răstignire</span> <span begin="2:23.783" end="2:25.035">de-ar</span> <span begin="2:25.035" end="2:28.791">privi:</span></p><p begin="2:28.791" end="2:38.181" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.791" end="2:30.669">Nimeni</span> <span begin="2:30.669" end="2:31.295">ca</span> <span begin="2:31.295" end="2:33.799">Tine,</span> <span begin="2:33.799" end="2:35.677">Doamne</span> <span begin="2:35.677" end="2:38.181">Isuse,</span></p><p begin="2:38.181" end="2:45.067" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.181" end="2:38.807">N-a</span> <span begin="2:38.807" end="2:39.433">fost</span> <span begin="2:39.433" end="2:40.059">și</span> <span begin="2:40.059" end="2:40.685">nici</span> <span begin="2:40.685" end="2:41.311">nu</span> <span begin="2:41.311" end="2:42.563">va</span> <span begin="2:42.563" end="2:43.815">mai</span> <span begin="2:43.815" end="2:45.067">fi!</span></p></div></body></tt>